      "jcr:created": "Tue Oct 11 2022 15:23:55 GMT+0000",
      "text": "Ronda Stryker Director since 1984, Governance and Nominating Committee Vice Chair and a Director of Greenleaf Trust Ms. Stryker is the granddaughter of the founder of Stryker and daughter of a former President of the company. She is also Vice Chair and a Director of Greenleaf Trust, a Michigan chartered bank, Vice Chair of Spelman College and member of the Harvard Medical School Board of Fellows. Ms. Stryker brings a strong interest in advocating the benefits of diversity and various matters regarding social responsibility. As one of our largest individual shareholders and a member of the founding family, she brings a strong shareholder perspective, unlike that of any other member of our Board, making her a valuable contributor to our Board.",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Oct 11 2022 15:28:45 GMT+0000",
